{"format_version": 2, "segments": [{"kind": "text", "text": "παν-υ^πέρτατος, η, ον, highest of all,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μεγέθει π. Arist. Mu. 397a15", "author_abbreviation": "Arist.", "tlg_author": "0086", "tlg_work": "028", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; π. ἐρρίζωνται, of trees, are rooted highest on the mountain,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A.R. 1.1122", "author_abbreviation": "A.R.", "tlg_author": "0001", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": hence, most remote or farthest from land, π. εἰν ἁλὶ κεῖται, of Ithaca,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 9.25", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". supreme,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Call. Jov. 91", "author_abbreviation": "Call.", "tlg_author": "0533", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Orph. H. 19.2", "author_abbreviation": "Orph.", "tlg_author": "0579", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ",al."}]}